    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "pali": "2. Dutiyamāravagga ",
      "english": "2. About Māra (2nd) "
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "pali": "Māradhammasutta ",
      "english": "Subject to Māra "
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
      "english": "At Sāvatthī. "
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho āyasmā rādho bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
      "english": "Seated to one side, Venerable Rādha said to the Buddha: "
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "“‘māradhammo, māradhammo’ti, bhante, vuccati. ",
      "english": "“Sir, they speak of ‘Māra nature’. "
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "pali": "Katamo nu kho, bhante, māradhammo”ti? ",
      "english": "What is of Māra nature?” "
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "pali": "“Rūpaṁ kho, rādha, māradhammo, vedanā māradhammo, saññā māradhammo, saṅkhārā māradhammo, viññāṇaṁ māradhammo. ",
      "english": "“Rādha, form is of Māra nature. Feeling, perception, choices, and consciousness are of Māra nature. "
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "pali": "Evaṁ passaṁ …pe… ",
      "english": "Seeing this … "
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "pali": "nāparaṁ itthattāyāti pajānātī”ti. ",
      "english": "They understand: ‘… there is nothing further for this place.’” "
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "pali": "Dutiyaṁ. ",
      "english": ""
    }
  ]
}